#!args --no-system-fonts
# JFDiagrammer, JD7, golden images (light theme, the style's fonts): a dynamic connector glued
# to two shapes routes around a third one between them (both ends glued: green; JD21v: out of the
# first shape's facing side, over the third one into the second's top, as Visio 16); the third
# shape turned by its rotation handle and moved into the connector's way: the connector routes
# again (below), the turned frame shows its eight handles and the rotation handle.  (JD21v) The
# third shape is made placeable first (Layout-Verhalten: Layout und Routing um das Shape, ObjType
# 1): Visio 16 routes only around placeable shapes, a drawn one (0) it crosses.
# New references: the same script with "shot FILE X Y W H" in place of "expect same" (look first)
theme light
cmd 4404
drag 500,330 640,420
drag 840,330 980,420
drag 690,290 770,470
cmd 4400
click 730,380
cmd 5422
expect dialog:"Layout-Verhalten" exists
click radio:"Layout und Routing um das Shape"
click button:"OK"
cmd 4401
drag 560,370 900,370
expect same apps/JFDiagrammer/tests/golden/edit_route.png 380 180 640 380
cmd 4400
click 730,330
drag button:"Drehgriff" 800,250
drag 735,380 735,330
expect same apps/JFDiagrammer/tests/golden/edit_handles.png 380 180 640 380
